  "notes": [
    "Polished original game UI with a consistent local Lucide icon set, readable labels, clearer selected and disabled states, and a prominent Resume action with an Escape key hint.",
    "Settings use distinct selected tabs, aligned controls, current brightness and mouse sensitivity values, quieter guidance and shared icon actions. Display apply, keep, revert and automatic rollback are preserved.",
    "Playable Blackwater and Briarwake incident files have larger images and actions. Planned Corn Maze and Stone Labyrinth entries are quieter, locked Coming Soon files, with accurately labelled concept art and sketches.",
    "Co-op shows the ready count and reason beside Start. Survivor dossiers communicate selection, availability and readiness. Results distinguish survival, death and departure with an icon and text, and identify your row from the connected player identity.",
    "Native UI review covered 744 draw states across four resolutions and three HUD sizes in both levels, with zero measured clipping or overlap findings. Settings persistence and display rollback passed, plus four real Relay peers completed two rounds across both levels.",
    "Blackwater and Briarwake support offline solo or private 2-4 player invite-code co-op. Corn Maze and Stone Labyrinth remain planned. Windows keyboard and mouse alpha; no saved run progress.",
    "Close the game, then choose Update & restart in the launcher. Everyone in a lobby should use the same build. The installer includes the full game and launcher."
  ],
